[[File:Map053.png|center|350px]]
'''Yandere Chemistry''' (偏愛化学実験場 ''Hen'ai Kagaku Jikkenjō'', '''Favoritism Chemical Test Site''') is the 35th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 133rd sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Most stages in this sub-chapter are relatively easy due to certain design flaws like the enemies having poor or even anti-synergy with each other, and being made up of traits that are very easily countered by multi-targeting units, or even just strong attackers in general.

The last stage is somewhat of a difficulty spike compared to the rest, combining [[Marquis Clionius]] with large amounts of [[Metal]] and [[Aku]] enemies that make a much stronger combination and cover each others' weaknesses.

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Marquis Clionius]]: An [[Aku]]/[[Sage]] [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] variant that has lower health and attack power, but [[Freeze]]s units, [[Drain]]s their ongoing cooldowns by 25%, has a powerful [[Shield]], and is immune to [[Explosion]]s.

